# satishfulwani.github.io

Static personal portfolio. No build step. GitHub Pages deploys the repo root via `.github/workflows/static.yml` on push to `main`.

## Pages

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `index.html` | Single-page marketing site (hero → work → projects → experience → about → credentials → contact) |
| `projects.html` | Case studies; work anchors first, then personal projects |
| `resume.html` | Printable resume; `@media print` rules must stay intact |

Shared: `custom.css`, `script.js`, `assets/` (images, `Satish_Fulwani_Resume.pdf`).

## Resume PDF

`generate_pdf.sh` prints `resume.html` with headless Chrome to `assets/Satish_Fulwani_Resume.pdf`. Homepage “Download Resume” uses the PDF; nav “Resume” can link to `resume.html` on secondary pages.

